WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.340 --> 00:00:01.270
- Valentine's Day is coming up.

00:00:01.270 --> 00:00:02.530
Do you and Dave ever do anything

00:00:02.530 --> 00:00:03.810
or are y'all chill about it?

00:00:03.810 --> 00:00:05.490
- We don't really do anything.

00:00:05.490 --> 00:00:06.323
- We don't either.

00:00:06.323 --> 00:00:07.370
- [Alison] We don't care.

00:00:07.370 --> 00:00:09.130
- [Kelly] I want every day
to be special, not just one.

00:00:09.130 --> 00:00:11.321
You're not getting just one
day you have to be nice.

00:00:11.321 --> 00:00:12.154
You know what I'm saying?
(audience applauds)

00:00:12.154 --> 00:00:14.371
- I agree, yes.

00:00:14.371 --> 00:00:15.860
- I would like several.
- I've always really felt,

00:00:15.860 --> 00:00:18.293
yes, I feel like if you're
in a good relationship

00:00:18.293 --> 00:00:21.390
and you're loving to your
partner all the time.

00:00:21.390 --> 00:00:25.350
I feel like I'm much more
a fan of the surprise gift,

00:00:25.350 --> 00:00:28.020
coming home on a Tuesday.
- Just a Monday night, yes.

00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:28.980
- And there's flowers

00:00:28.980 --> 00:00:29.867
and a little card that's like,

00:00:29.867 --> 00:00:32.110
"I love you, I appreciate you."

00:00:32.110 --> 00:00:33.900
Or I'll leave him, if
I'm gonna leave town,

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:36.310
we'll leave each other
little cards or stuff

00:00:36.310 --> 00:00:37.860
on each other's pillow.
- That's awesome.

00:00:37.860 --> 00:00:39.070
- All the time.
- My husband does that

00:00:39.070 --> 00:00:39.903
all the time.

00:00:39.903 --> 00:00:41.570
- So Valentine's Day is like oh,

00:00:41.570 --> 00:00:42.627
I feel like we're always
at the last second,

00:00:42.627 --> 00:00:45.550
"Oh, honey, I love you."

00:00:45.550 --> 00:00:47.200
- [Kelly] You're great.

00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:48.570
- Yes, and then we'll throw something.

00:00:48.570 --> 00:00:49.920
Usually, maybe I'll cook dinner

00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:50.753
and we'll watch a movie,

00:00:50.753 --> 00:00:52.670
which is what we do
- Every night.

00:00:52.670 --> 00:00:55.190
- most nights, if I'm not working, anyway.

00:00:55.190 --> 00:00:57.830
But it has that special tinge.

00:00:57.830 --> 00:00:58.800
- Sometimes I feel like Valentine's Day,

00:00:58.800 --> 00:01:00.440
all it does is start fights.

00:01:00.440 --> 00:01:04.010
- I think the only purpose
of it is to sell flowers

00:01:04.010 --> 00:01:04.970
and greeting cards

00:01:04.970 --> 00:01:07.120
and to get young couples

00:01:07.120 --> 00:01:10.120
and very new couples who have
been dating a couple months

00:01:10.120 --> 00:01:11.140
to get in a big fight.

00:01:11.140 --> 00:01:12.610
- They're just giving you, yeah,

00:01:12.610 --> 00:01:14.590
you're just gonna screw up.
- It's like a real test

00:01:14.590 --> 00:01:16.910
for someone that you've been
on a handful of dates with

00:01:16.910 --> 00:01:18.750
and you're like, what's he gonna do?

00:01:18.750 --> 00:01:20.000
- Oh my god.
- What's he gonna do?

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:21.843
Did he plan something?
- I hate that pressure.

